{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#card-zh","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-mode 是把 Context Mode 接入 DeepSeek Harness 的插件，面向使用 DSH 的开发者。它在进程内加载 context-mode 引擎，将其 ctx_* 工具注册到 DSH 工具目录，并把上下文路由建议加入系统提示。主要能力包括在沙箱中执行代码、索引和搜索内容、抓取并索引资料、查看知识库状态，以及清理或检查存储。插件还可按配置隐藏工具、指定引擎路径和存储目录。它适合希望减少原始工具输出进入对话、并在本地维护可检索知识库的用户；需要 Node.js 22.5 及 context-mode 依赖，不要求额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:154-212","index.js:239-285","cordis.patch.yml:13-30"]}
{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#card-en","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-context-mode connects Context Mode to DSH. It registers ctx_* tools and routing guidance. Users can execute code, index and search material, inspect the knowledge base, and manage stored content. Requires Node.js 22.5+ and context-mode; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:154-212","index.js:239-285","cordis.patch.yml:13-30"]}
