{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#feature-1","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-mode 的功能「原生上下文工具」：加载 Context Mode 引擎并把可用 ctx_* 工具注册到 DSH 工具目录。会话可调用执行、索引、搜索和状态管理等工具，插件配置可选择显示哪些工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:157-200"]}
{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#feature-2","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-mode 的功能「上下文路由提示」：插件启动时向系统提示加入 context-mode 路由章节，提供工具选择和上下文窗口管理指引；可通过 routing 配置关闭。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:205-210","index.js:419-441"]}
{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#feature-3","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-mode 的功能「独立存储目录」：将引擎的数据根目录设为 DSH 专属位置，默认位于 DSH_HOME/context-mode 或 ~/.dsh/context-mode，也可用 storageDir 覆盖。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:214-230"]}
{"unit_id":"icanfinish11__dsh-context-mode#caveat-1","repo":"icanfinish11/dsh-context-mode","commit":"587430c1590791873b68a620eb9a5f25ce62d3b5","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-context-mode 只接入工具和路由提示，没有接入自动会话连续性捕获；需要持久记忆时应显式调用索引工具。","source":"generated","evidence":["README.md:32-33"]}
